  "contract": [
    "Filesystem and object-store restore targets expose decision-bound ImportActivator operations.",
    "Activation preserves the exact import identity and retains historical, preparing, and active receipts. Every partial state refuses ordinary startup.",
    "Conditional PUT replaces the import barrier. Exact retry preserves later payloads and refuses a competing decision.",
    "Portable historical receipts cannot establish current authority. Backup includes historical receipts but excludes native current markers.",
    "Activation retries recover owned filesystem publication journals. Unknown or corrupt journals remain and cause refusal.",
    "An interrupted condition probe leaves ordinary inert payload bytes. Backup preserves those bytes without interpreting them as permission.",
    "The recovery coordinator still owns independent history, external fencing, complete file placement, and final SQL admission."
